[2] Liu QY, Chen D, Shang C, Liu ZP. An optimal Fe–C coordination ensemble for hydrocarbon chain growth: a full Fischer–Tropsch synthesis
mechanism from machine learning. Chem Sci **2023**;*14*:9461–75